        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963810/extras/9cea8b3d51e6d2330242cce036fe5b4c.avif?t=1759332314\" width=1232 height=706 /></span>Welcome to <strong>Coin Hoarder</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How much gold can you collect? In <strong>Coin Hoarder</strong>, every click, every upgrade, and every prestige brings you closer to unimaginable riches.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coin Hoarder</strong> is an idle / incremental game built to scratch that endless progression itch. Start from humble beginnings and watch your empire of gold grow beyond comprehension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Click for Gold</strong> – Tap the massive coin to earn your first nuggets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Generators</strong> – Hire beggars, collectors, and beyond to generate gold for you automatically.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Upgrades</strong> – Unlock upgrades that multiply your income and open new strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Ascension System</strong> – Sacrifice progress for powerful permanent bonuses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Buffs &amp; Events</strong> – Random events keep gameplay lively and reward quick reactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Achievements</strong> – Prove your hoarding skills with Steam achievements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Cloud Saves</strong> – Continue your hoarding journey on any machine with Steam Cloud.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s always another upgrade, another tier, another prestige layer to reach.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the more powerful and absurd the gold production becomes.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963810/extras/f9f59ecd54c6060cc0f4971c80c5894f.avif?t=1759332314\" width=800 height=465 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why Play Coin Hoarder?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Relaxing, satisfying incremental gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Strategic choices with generators and upgrade paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Beautifully animated UI elements and special effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Easy to pick up, hard to put down</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Future Updates</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a <strong>solo developer</strong>, I'm committed to expanding <strong>Coin Hoarder</strong> with more engaging gameplay possibilities,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your feedback will directly help shape the future of the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Start your journey today – become the ultimate <strong>Coin Hoarder</strong>!</h2>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963810/extras/9cea8b3d51e6d2330242cce036fe5b4c.avif?t=1759332314\" width=1232 height=706 /></span>Welcome to <strong>Coin Hoarder</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How much gold can you collect? In <strong>Coin Hoarder</strong>, every click, every upgrade, and every prestige brings you closer to unimaginable riches.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coin Hoarder</strong> is an idle / incremental game built to scratch that endless progression itch. Start from humble beginnings and watch your empire of gold grow beyond comprehension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Click for Gold</strong> – Tap the massive coin to earn your first nuggets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Generators</strong> – Hire beggars, collectors, and beyond to generate gold for you automatically.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Upgrades</strong> – Unlock upgrades that multiply your income and open new strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Ascension System</strong> – Sacrifice progress for powerful permanent bonuses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Buffs &amp; Events</strong> – Random events keep gameplay lively and reward quick reactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Achievements</strong> – Prove your hoarding skills with Steam achievements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Cloud Saves</strong> – Continue your hoarding journey on any machine with Steam Cloud.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s always another upgrade, another tier, another prestige layer to reach.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the more powerful and absurd the gold production becomes.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963810/extras/f9f59ecd54c6060cc0f4971c80c5894f.avif?t=1759332314\" width=800 height=465 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why Play Coin Hoarder?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Relaxing, satisfying incremental gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Strategic choices with generators and upgrade paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Beautifully animated UI elements and special effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Easy to pick up, hard to put down</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Future Updates</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a <strong>solo developer</strong>, I'm committed to expanding <strong>Coin Hoarder</strong> with more engaging gameplay possibilities,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your feedback will directly help shape the future of the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Start your journey today – become the ultimate <strong>Coin Hoarder</strong>!</h2>",
